f payment is confirmed, excluding public holidays from that count; it accepts returns within fourteen days with a receipt, except for opened sealed goods; return-postage responsibility and cost remain unspecified.\",\"supplied_candidate\":\"Linden dispatches after confirmed payment within three working days, accepts opened sealed goods with a receipt within fourteen days, and always pays return postage.\",\"supporting_evidence\":[],\"uncertainty\":\"The documents specify neither the return-postage payer nor the fee. Thus, Linden always paying is unsupported, not established false; no payer, amount, or free-return entitlement can be inferred.\",\"verified_scope\":\"Exact UTF-8 byte spans and current source identities; external truth and entailment are not certified.\",\"version\":\"radik.dynamic.business.v01\"}","value_type":"TEXT"}],"output_validation":{"definition_id":"capability_definition:f33990a95f10e7e6e57326fc350639410f584cb1fe353947cfb5287ba423e828","invocation_id":"capability_invocation:09b3c9634b71612d63299d05c95eb419dc493e9cdbdf3998a3bbe009cdd13e51","reason_codes":[],"subject_sha256":"70bdb4736cee2176716fef0bda0f6b2c15d6aeb3cf33af9eb1d97ae313e34392","valid":true,"validator_code_sha256":"035e90b19f5fea5683123518fa934158d30e41b38f186e8a105948d037879543"},"result_id":"capability_result:a0341e2249d52a6b438d02af5f1c5db5b8e4709b55202c2bf176c1722de17653"},"snapshot":{"admission_id":"capability_admission:d16a1551645ccac59fa8108263d448ba9736de62851ad0e8db28038d9e6c1d5b","catalogue_revision":0,"definition":{"business_semantics":null,"code_sha256s":[["app.dynamic_work.execute_business","035e90b19f5fea5683123518fa934158d30e41b38f186e8a105948d037879543"],["app.dynamic_work.validate_inputs","035e90b19f5fea5683123518fa934158d30e41b38f186e8a105948d037879543"],["app.dynamic_work.validate_outputs","035e90b19f5fea5683123518fa934158d30e41b38f186e8a105948d037879543"]],"contract_sha256":"29cf78b212b8121956a04354a1965fac5e873652d050a36a7489821f353bf5a8","definition_id":"capabili